      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#wm-1658\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003EWM 1658\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E;",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make a Sack Posset.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTake a quart of Cream and boyle it very well with Sugar, Mace, and Nutmeg, take half a pint of Sack, and as much Ale, and boyle them well together with some Sugar, then put your Cream into your Bason to your Sacke, then heat a pewter dish very hot, and cover your Bason with it, and set it by the fire side, and let it stand there two or three houres before you eat it.\u003Cbr\u003E"
